        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-28T19:53:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think you're spot on, Rabit.&nbsp; Five heroes would also be far more capable of killing her quickly once she leaves herself open, while three might have to whittle her down over time she doesn't give you.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Maybe we need some Villain Guides to help folks understand how to defeat the various villains…  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Working on it.&nbsp; But if you want Matriarch strategy, awp has a great guide on here somewhere.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
